### =========================================================================
### 1. CORE FETCH OPERATIONS (GET)
### =========================================================================

### Get all tickets (Unfiltered)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/tickets

### Get one existing ticket (Make sure ID matches an active document in your DB)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/tickets/6a51e41521c1ecf8f0a0a40f

### Get one missing ticket (Verifies your 404 Custom Exception Handling)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/tickets/000000000000000000000000


### =========================================================================
### 2. TICKET CREATION OPERATIONS (POST)
### =========================================================================

### Create a valid ticket (Should return 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "VPN connection drops frequently",
  "description": "The secure global VPN disconnects automatically every 10 to 15 minutes while working remotely.",
  "category": "Network",
  "priority": "High",
  "createdBy": "Adam"
}

### Create an invalid ticket (Should return 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "",
  "category": "",
  "priority": "",
  "createdBy": ""
}


### =========================================================================
### 3. EXERCISE 8.1: DYNAMIC QUERY FILTERS
### =========================================================================

### Filter by Status
GET http://localhost:8082/api/tickets?status=Open

### Filter by Priority
GET http://localhost:8082/api/tickets?priority=High

### Filter by Category
GET http://localhost:8082/api/tickets?category=Network


